                                                "sense_id": "9058b807-0d18-3ed2-adfc-7cd3650b13f9",
                                                "text": "Here was a blazingly erotic sex star par excellence as Travolta gyrated around that strobing disco dance floor like a cock-o'-the-walk."
                                            },
